WEBVTT

00:01:29.551 --> 00:01:31.472
Tayyormisiz?

00:01:31.472 --> 00:01:34.155
Og'zingizni iloji boricha katta oching,

00:01:34.155 --> 00:01:36.201
kvadrat formasiga kirguniga qadar.

00:01:36.201 --> 00:01:38.883
Bu og'iz.

00:01:38.883 --> 00:01:41.971
Bu sayrga chiqqan odam.

00:01:41.971 --> 00:01:45.102
Inson.

00:01:45.102 --> 00:01:47.811
Agar olov shaklida insonni tasavvur qilsak,

00:01:47.811 --> 00:01:50.081
ikki tarafida qo'llari bilan,

00:01:50.081 --> 00:01:52.251
bu xuddi "Yordam bering, yonayapman!" deb

00:01:52.251 --> 00:01:55.804
qichqirayotgan ayolga o'xshab qoladi.

00:01:55.804 --> 00:01:59.971
Bu belgi olov shaklidan kelib chiqqan,

00:01:59.971 --> 00:02:03.784
lekin menga buni boshqacha tasavvur qilish yoqadi.